      "writtenOn": "2024-09-09T19:27:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this scenario, should the `stubs_visibility` of `foo` be updated in its Android.bp file?\n\nIIUC, is your proposal that if `bar` requires stubs of `foo`, all sub modules of `foo` (impl+stubs) should be visible to `bar`? \n\nIs it an intermediate proposal or will it remain after the \"magic\" has been removed?",
      "parentUuid": "f5a779af_12fb49c6",
      "range": {
